  "content": "<br>\n\n<center>\n\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/logo/logo.png\" width=\"100%\" alt=\"Friends＆Foes - 繁花哞菇\" title=\"Friends＆Foes - 繁花哞菇\">\n</center>\n\n<br>\n\n<center>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/faboslav\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=%E8%AB%8B%E6%88%91%E5%96%9D%E5%92%96%E5%95%A1&color=5b9c51&labelColor=5b9c51&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=ko-fi\" alt=\"請我喝咖啡\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=%E6%88%90%E7%82%BA%E8%B4%8A%E5%8A%A9%E8%80%85&color=5b9c51&labelColor=5b9c51&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=patreon\" alt=\"Patreon\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/924964658169913404?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=ffffff&label=%E5%8A%A0%E5%85%A5%E6%88%91%E5%80%91%E7%9A%84Discord&labelColor=5b9c51&color=5b9c51\" alt=\"加入我們的Discord\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Moobloom\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=%E7%B6%AD%E5%9F%BA&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&labelColor=5b9c51&color=5b9c51\" alt=\"維基\">\n\t</a>\n</center>\n\n<br>\n\n<p>\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Friends＆Foes - 繁花哞菇 是 Friends＆Foes 模組的一個小型附加元件，為每種花卉添加了一種哞菇變種。繁花哞菇可以在草地和花森林生態域中找到。您可以查閱<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Moobloom\">維基</a>以獲取更多關於繁花哞菇的資訊。</span>\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>🐮 繁花哞菇變種</h1>\n\n<table>\n\t<tbody>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>紫紅球花</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>茜草花</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_allium.png\" width=\"133\" alt=\"紫紅球花哞菇\" title=\"紫紅球花哞菇\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_azure_bluet.png\" width=\"146\" alt=\"茜草花哞菇\" title=\"茜草花哞菇\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>藍色 orchid</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>矢車菊</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_blue_orchid.png\" width=\"149\" alt=\"藍色 orchid 哞菇\" title=\"藍色 orchid 哞菇\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_cornflower.png\" width=\"139\" alt=\"矢車菊哞菇\" title=\"矢車菊哞菇\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>蒲公英</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>丁香</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_dandelion.png\" width=\"149\" alt=\"蒲公英哞菇\" title=\"蒲公英哞菇\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_lilac.png\" width=\"144\" alt=\"丁香哞菇\" title=\"丁香哞菇\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>鈴蘭</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>橙色鬱金香</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_lily_of_the_valley.png\" width=\"140\" alt=\"鈴蘭哞菇\" title=\"鈴蘭哞菇\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_orange_tulip.png\" width=\"137\" alt=\"橙色鬱金香哞菇\" title=\"橙色鬱金香哞菇\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>雛菊</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>牡丹</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_oxeye_daisy.png\" width=\"134\" alt=\"雛菊哞菇\" title=\"雛菊哞菇\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_peony.png\" width=\"150\" alt=\"牡丹哞菇\" title=\"牡丹哞菇\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>粉色鬱金香</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>罌粟</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_pink_tulip.png\" width=\"137\" alt=\"粉色鬱金香哞菇\" title=\"粉色鬱金香哞菇\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_poppy.png\" width=\"142\" alt=\"罌粟哞菇\" title=\"罌粟哞菇\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>紅色鬱金香</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>玫瑰叢</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_red_tulip.png\" width=\"137\" alt=\"紅色鬱金香哞菇\" title=\"紅色鬱金香哞菇\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_rose_bush.png\" width=\"142\" alt=\"玫瑰叢哞菇\" title=\"玫瑰叢哞菇\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>向日葵</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"442\" height=\"1\">\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>白色鬱金香</strong></p>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_sunflower.png\" width=\"150\" alt=\"向日葵哞菇\" title=\"向日葵哞菇\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/.github/assets/images/moobloom_white_tulip.png\" width=\"137\" alt=\"白色鬱金香哞菇\" title=\"白色鬱金香哞菇\"/>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<br>\n\n<h1>⚙️ 其他附加元件 / 相容資料包</h1>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><a style=\"font-size: 18px;\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/friends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut-forge\">Friends＆Foes - 養蜂人小屋</a></li>\t\n\t<li><a style=\"font-size: 18px;\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/repurposed-structures-friends-and-foes-datapack\">改造結構 - Friends and Foes 相容資料包</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n\n<h1>💬 社群</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t歡迎<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\">加入我們的 Discord 伺服器社群</a>，與我們聊天、分享您的創作、提出任何問題，或簡單地獲取模組的最新開發資訊，並在新版本發布時收到通知。也請不要猶豫，<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/issues\">透過 GitHub Issues 回報任何崩潰或錯誤</a>。\n</p>\n\n<br>\n\n<h2>👋 支持</h2>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">無論是否有支持，我都會繼續開發我的模組，因為這是我的嗜好，不過我大部分的空閒時間都投入在模組開發上。所以如果您無論如何想支持我，可以透過 <a style=\"font-size: 18px;\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\">Patreon</a> 或 <a style=\"font-size: 18px;\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/faboslav\">Ko-fi</a> 進行。話雖如此，我非常感謝您們所有的支持。</span></p>\n\n<br>\n\n<h1>📜 許可證</h1>\n\n<p>\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">此模組採用 <a style=\"font-size: 18px;\" href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms/master/LICENSE.txt\">CC BY-NC-ND 4.0</a> 許可證。</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">歡迎查看我的程式碼，了解在編寫此模組時我如何實作和解決各種問題，並將程式碼片段整合到您自己的程式碼中。也歡迎在任何模組包中使用此模組（不過非常感謝您能標註來源或提供此頁面的連結）。</span>\n</p>",
